{"4789610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unheenged", "steam_appid": 4789610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/e209f1a1c9d561f51748eccebfc2b131.poster.avif?t=1782172350\" width=1138 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/e209f1a1c9d561f51748eccebfc2b131.webm?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/e209f1a1c9d561f51748eccebfc2b131.mp4?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unheenged is a cooperative horror extraction game for you and up to 3 friends. featuring proximity voice chat, scary monsters, multiple items and doors... Lots of doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/0cb28303d1ff513912029172425215e1.poster.avif?t=1782172350\" width=1138 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/0cb28303d1ff513912029172425215e1.webm?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/0cb28303d1ff513912029172425215e1.mp4?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and experience a mansion lost to dark forces. Locate the key required to escape each floor by opening doors and uncovering new rooms, finding and hoarding items along the way. Between each floor you'll be able to visit the mansion's store where you can buy items and player upgrades to aid you in your exploration deeper into the mansion's interior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The map is procedurally generated and every floor will increase in size. All items and monsters are also randomized making each run new and unique.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/f29517db76e133d0e9fb610f39a431d6.poster.avif?t=1782172350\" width=1138 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/f29517db76e133d0e9fb610f39a431d6.webm?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/f29517db76e133d0e9fb610f39a431d6.mp4?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize proximity voice chat to communicate with friends and engage in productive cooperation to ensure swift and accident free locating of the key between each floor... Or don't..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/83901a16d1545f1d2546cf33e2a7b5e9.poster.avif?t=1782172350\" width=1138 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/83901a16d1545f1d2546cf33e2a7b5e9.webm?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/83901a16d1545f1d2546cf33e2a7b5e9.mp4?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items scattered throughout the mansion to sell and save up to purchase both items and upgrades directly from the mansion store. &quot;Short on Tokeens? No problem, your friend will do!&quot; - Shopkeep</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/766cc70fbb693ba6f5b430ef9936a42a.poster.avif?t=1782172350\" width=1138 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/766cc70fbb693ba6f5b430ef9936a42a.webm?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/766cc70fbb693ba6f5b430ef9936a42a.mp4?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are doors... You will be opening them.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/e209f1a1c9d561f51748eccebfc2b131.poster.avif?t=1782172350\" width=1138 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/e209f1a1c9d561f51748eccebfc2b131.webm?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/e209f1a1c9d561f51748eccebfc2b131.mp4?t=1782172350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unheenged is a cooperative horror extraction game for you and up to 3 friends. featuring proximity voice chat, scary monsters, multiple items and doors... Lots of doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789610/extras/0cb28303d1ff513912029172425215e1.poster.avif?t=1782172350\" width=1138 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati